 {:href "/athletes/2504470"} "Kaylee McKeown"] " on the opener."] "\n\n" [:p {} [:a {:href "/athletes/154785"} "Gretchen Walsh"] " put the USA back in first after the butterfly, but barely so, only 0.04 seconds ahead of " [:a {:href "/athletes/129678"} "Zhang Yufei"] " and China. " [:a {:href "/athletes/147283"} "Torri Huske"] " was the American freestyler, and she brought home the gold medal, but it was always in doubt, as " [:a {:href "/athletes/2504727"} "Yang Junxuan"] " chased her to the wall, the United States winning by only 0.12 seconds in a world record 3:37.43. Australia, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/140694"} "Mollie O’Callaghan"] " anchoring, took the bronze medal, more than a second behind China."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "United States"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "3:40.98 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "3:37.43 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "10"} [:a {:href "/athletes/136367"} "Ryan Murphy"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/147475"} "Nic Fink"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/154785"} "Gretchen Walsh"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/147283"} "Torri Huske"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/147282"} "Regan Smith"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/154790"} "Charlie Swanson"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/136353"} "Caeleb Dressel"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/132152"} "Abbey Weitzeil"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "People's Republic of China"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {}